t("What just happened?!", "¿Qué acaba de pasar!", "_t")
t("I'm sorry I didn't manage to protect you and as you were about to die you... fired a powerful wave of blight.", "Siento no haber conseguido protegerte y mientras estabas a punto de morir... despidió una poderosa ola de luz.", "_t")
t("But I have never cast a spell in my life!", "¡Pero nunca he lanzado un hechizo en mi vida!", "_t")
t("You are still tainted by that ... foul Demon! The taint is not all gone!", "Aún estás contaminada por ese... ¡Demonio asqueroso! ¡La pintura no se ha ido!", "_t")
t("There must be some of that demon's taint still inside you.", "Debe haber una mancha de ese demonio todavía dentro de ti.", "_t")
t("This is terrible! I assure you I had no idea this would happen. You must trust me!", "¡Esto es terrible! Le aseguro que no tenía idea de que esto pasaría. ¡Debes confiar en mí!", "_t")
t("I do. The Ziguranth are not raving zealots, you know. We will look for a way to cure you, as long as you reject the blight.", "Sí. Los Ziguranth no son fantasiosos, sabes. Buscaremos una manera de curarte, siempre y cuando rechaces la luz.", "_t")
t("This is terrible! What is happening to me?!? You must help me!", "¡Esto es terrible! ¿Qué me estás pasando? ¡Debes ayudarme!", "_t")
t("I will. We will find a cure for this together.", "Lo haré. Encontraremos una curas para esto juntos.", "_t")
t("I'm a very lucky girl, am I not... This is the second time I've had you to save me now.", "Soy una chica muy afortunada, no soy... Esta eres la segunda vez que te he tenido que salvarme ahora.", "_t")
t("Over the last weeks you've become very important to me, and I am glad to have you. This is certainly not the place to talk, though, let's go.", "Durante las últimas semanas te has vuelto muy importante para mí, y me alegra tenerte. Sin embargo, este no eres el lugar para hablar, vamos.", "_t")
t("You're right, let's get out of here.", "Tienes razón, salgamos de aquí.", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#[go back to Last Hope]", "#LIGHT_GREEN# [regresa a Last Hope]", "_t")

